摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Native AnySearch /v1/search WebSearchProvider for DeepSeek Harness with Web UI, credentials integration, and Web/Headless support.","id":"gh:1336597474","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-web-search-anysearch","slug":"mcxianyujun/dsh-web-search-anysearch","topics":["anysearch","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Native AnySearch /v1/search WebSearchProvider for DeepSeek Harness with Web UI, credentials integrat"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ion, and Web/Headless support."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-web-search-anysearch"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**AnySearch Web Search Provider for DeepSeek Harness.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A native `WebSearchProvider` plugin that connects the harness `ctx.web` seam to the AnySearch\n`POST "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"/v1/search` REST API. It ships a **dedicated Web settings section** for\nconfiguration, stores the AP"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"I key through the **DSH credentials service**, and supports both the\n**Web** and **Headless** profil"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ey through the **DSH credentials service**, and supports both the\n**Web** and **Headless** profiles."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"This is a native provider — not an MCP server, not a Skill, and not a fork or patch of DeepSeek\nHarn"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ess. No Harness core source is modified."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Two install paths are available — the **DSH CLI (npm)** route and the **Windows PowerShell\ninstaller"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"** (see Installation). The Windows installer flow is:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. **Install** (Windows):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"2. **Restart** DeepSeek Harness (`searchProvider` is read when the web seam is constructed)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"3. Open **Settings → 网页搜索（AnySearch）** and enter your AnySearch API key. It is stored by the\nDSH cre"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"dentials service, never in a settings file."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"4. Ask the agent something that requires web search — the harness `web_search` tool now uses AnySear"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"Ask the agent something that requires web search — the harness `web_search` tool now uses AnySearch."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- Native DeepSeek Harness `WebSearchProvider` (`id: anysearch`) over `ctx.web`\n- AnySearch native `P"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"OST /v1/search` REST API (not the MCP `/mcp` JSON-RPC bridge)\n- Dedicated **Web settings section** ("},{"id":"p15s3","text":"independent of the DeepSeek search provider)\n- Independent credentials — `ANYSEARCH_API_KEY` and per"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"-field `ANYSEARCH_*` references, never\nreusing the DeepSeek provider's key\n- API key stored by the D"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"SH credentials service, never written to settings documents\n- Source preservation — `url` / `title` "},{"id":"p15s6","text":"/ `snippet` are mapped intact and deduplicated by URL\n- Configurable **Max Results** (1–20), **Zone*"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"* (`cn`/`intl`), **Language**, **Format**\n(`json`/`markdown`), and **Base URL**\n- Web profile suppor"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"t (GUI + settings section)\n- Headless profile support (CLI / automation)\n- Structured, non-fabricate"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"d error handling (401/403, 429, network, JSON, abnormal envelopes)\n- Minimal zero-network unit tests"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"\n- No Harness core patch required"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.2-rc.1` through\n`0.2.1-rc.x` with a `web` and/or `headless` profile. Both AP"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"I lines are supported: on 0.1.x the\nplugin installs its settings section, on 0.2.x (which removed th"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"e installer) it reads the entry's\nconfiguration and the credential references written by the GUI car"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"d. **Tested with the DeepSeek\nHarness desktop install (Node 24 / pnpm via corepack).**\n- An AnySearc"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"h API key (optional for low-rate anonymous use; recommended\nfor reliable access).\n- Node.js `>= 20` "},{"id":"p17s6","text":"and `pnpm` for the build step (the Harness desktop bundle ships both)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Option 1 — Install from npm with the DSH CLI"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Install the bundle for the Web profile:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"For Headless:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"This installs and registers the AnySearch bundle, but does **not** automatically change the active\nW"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"eb search provider. To enable AnySearch, add the following override to the target profile's\n`cordis."},{"id":"p24s3","text":"rovider. To enable AnySearch, add the following override to the target profile's\n`cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Then restart DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"> If `dsh plugin add` cannot find `pnpm` on Windows, use the PowerShell installer below — it locates"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"\n> the Node/corepack environment bundled with DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The package is published on npm as\n`dsh-web-search-anysearch`."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Option 2 — Windows PowerShell installer"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The installer modifies only the target profile's `package.json` (adds a `link:` dependency) and\n`cor"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"dis.patch.yml` (registers the provider and selects it). It backs up both files first and is\nidempote"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"nt — re-running it does not duplicate entries."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The installer also sets `searchProvider: anysearch` automatically, so no manual patch edit is needed"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"he installer also sets `searchProvider: anysearch` automatically, so no manual patch edit is needed."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Manual installation"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"For troubleshooting or environments where the script is not used:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"1. Add the plugin as a link dependency in `<DSH_HOME>/profiles/<profile>/package.json`:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"2. Add to `<DSH_HOME>/profiles/<profile>/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"3. Run `pnpm install` inside the profile directory, then restart the Harness."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The plugin's `@deepseek-ai/*` imports resolve from the **plugin directory's own `node_modules`**\n(in"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"stalled by `pnpm install` in the plugin directory), so no junction farms or manual symlinks are\nrequ"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ed by `pnpm install` in the plugin directory), so no junction farms or manual symlinks are\nrequired."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Configuration precedence (lowest → highest):"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"1. Hard-coded defaults (`https://api.anysearch.com`, `maxResults` 10, `format` json)\n2. Launching en"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"vironment (`ANYSEARCH_API_KEY`, `ANYSEARCH_BASE_URL`, …)\n3. The `web-search-anysearch` section in `<"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"DSH_HOME>/settings.yaml` (Harness 0.1.x only; 0.2.x\nremoved settings sections, so there the plugin e"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"ntry's own config is the only file-level layer)\n4. Credentials-service references written by the GUI"},{"id":"p43s5","text":" config is the only file-level layer)\n4. Credentials-service references written by the GUI (highest)"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| Field | Default | Notes |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"This is a native Harness `WebSearchProvider`, not an MCP server and not a Skill."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"- The API key is stored by the DSH credentials service, never in settings files or source code.\n- Th"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"e plugin never logs the full API key or the full `Authorization` header.\n- Do not commit `.env` or c"},{"id":"p50s3","text":"redentials documents.\n- Debug/session logs may contain sensitive data — review them before sharing.\n"},{"id":"p50s4","text":"- Real credentials must never appear in tests or fixtures; tests use mock values."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
